  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 0,
      "end": 0.82,
      "text": "What if Rock Lee woke"
    },
    {
      "start": 0.82,
      "end": 1.98,
      "text": "up with the Rinnegan?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1.98,
      "end": 3.62,
      "text": "The creator lost its damn mind."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.62,
      "end": 5.04,
      "text": "In this fan scenario, gravity"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.04,
      "end": 6.78,
      "text": "powers arrive before the instruction"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.78,
      "end": 8.04,
      "text": "manual."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.04,
      "end": 9.38,
      "text": "Excellent parenting from the universe."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.38,
      "end": 10.34,
      "text": "His first warm -up pulls"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.34,
      "end": 11.96,
      "text": "the weights toward his face."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.96,
      "end": 13.32,
      "text": "Bro ordered express shipping on"
    },
    {
      "start": 13.32,
      "end": 14.1,
      "text": "his concussion."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.1,
      "end": 15.36,
      "text": "Guy recommends control."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.36,
      "end": 16.8,
      "text": "Sir, your student just magnetized"
    },
    {
      "start": 16.8,
      "end": 17.88,
      "text": "the furniture."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.88,
      "end": 18.966081611527827,
      "text": "Start with eye safety."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.966081611527827,
      "end": 20.5860625,
      "text": "The eyes don't teach techniques."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.5860625,
      "end": 22.5660625,
      "text": "Chakra and concentration matter."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.5660625,
      "end": 24.846062500000002,
      "text": "Premium hardware, zero installed drivers."
    },
    {
      "start": 24.846062500000002,
      "end": 26.2460625,
      "text": "Lee practices pulling opponents off"
    },
    {
      "start": 26.2460625,
      "end": 27.8860625,
      "text": "balance before kicking."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.8860625,
      "end": 29.5460625,
      "text": "The practice dummy immediately requests"
    },
    {
      "start": 29.5460625,
      "end": 30.7860625,
      "text": "a different department."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.7860625,
      "end": 32.5660625,
      "text": "Then he notices teammates nearby."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.5660625,
      "end": 33.5260625,
      "text": "A wild push could hurt"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.5260625,
      "end": 34.6460625,
      "text": "people he protects."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.6460625,
      "end": 35.326062500000006,
      "text": "Guy gives him a precision"
    },
    {
      "start": 35.326062500000006,
      "end": 36.2460625,
      "text": "test."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.2460625,
      "end": 38.1660625,
      "text": "Move one falling leaf. Not the tree."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.1660625,
      "end": 38.94852740510882,
      "text": "Not the neighborhood."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.94852740510882,
      "end": 41.268499999999996,
      "text": "Leaves ignore inspirational speeches."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.268499999999996,
      "end": 43.128499999999995,
      "text": "An absolutely devastating review of"
    },
    {
      "start": 43.128499999999995,
      "end": 44.9685,
      "text": "his entire motivational brand."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.9685,
      "end": 46.128499999999995,
      "text": "Lee uses tiny pulls to"
    },
    {
      "start": 46.128499999999995,
      "end": 47.268499999999996,
      "text": "create openings."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.268499999999996,
      "end": 49.168499999999995,
      "text": "His powers cooperate with his training."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.168499999999995,
      "end": 50.5485,
      "text": "When a teammate falls, controlled"
    },
    {
      "start": 50.5485,
      "end": 51.988499999999995,
      "text": "force catches them."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.988499999999995,
      "end": 53.528499999999994,
      "text": "Saving somebody becomes more valuable"
    },
    {
      "start": 53.528499999999994,
      "end": 54.6485,
      "text": "than showing off."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.6485,
      "end": 55.5685,
      "text": "Guy cries."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.5685,
      "end": 56.4685,
      "text": "Lee cries."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.4685,
      "end": 57.9685,
      "text": "The leaf floats perfectly."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.9685,
      "end": 59.4885,
      "text": "Bro unlocked legendary eyes and"
    },
    {
      "start": 59.4885,
      "end": 60.9685,
      "text": "got defeated by landscaping."
    }
  ],
